1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Read a simple A1 haircut article.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:08,580
Learn how salons work, how to ask for a small change, and how to check the style before a role play.

3
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:10,200
Warm-Up Questions.

4
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:13,660
Where do you get your hair cut?

5
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,660
Can you say short, long, and a little in English?

6
00:00:17,960 --> 00:00:20,200
What can you say when the style is okay?

7
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:21,780
At the salon

8
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,140
Hello.

9
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:25,260
I have an appointment at three.

10
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:26,440
Welcome.

11
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,240
Please sit here.

12
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:28,140
Thank you.

13
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,360
I want a trim.

14
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,120
How short do you want it?

15
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:32,800
A little shorter, please.

16
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,000
Not too short.

17
00:00:34,400 --> 00:00:35,100
Okay.

18
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,940
I will cut a little.

19
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:38,860
Can you cut the front a little too?

20
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:39,840
Yes.

21
00:00:40,700 --> 00:00:42,140
Please look in the mirror.

22
00:00:42,620 --> 00:00:43,400
That looks good.

23
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,300
Thank you.

24
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:45,220
Great.

25
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:46,040
We are finished.

26
00:00:46,540 --> 00:00:47,700
How much is it?

27
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,860
It is twenty dollars.

28
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:50,890
You can pay at the counter.

29
